### 1. Register New User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "john",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "full_name": "John Doe",
  "mobile": "+91 9876543210",
  "date_of_birth": "1990-01-15"
}

###

### 2. Login User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 3. Get All Products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products

###

### 4. Get All Categories
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories

###

### 5. Add Product to Cart
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### 6. View Cart
GET http://localhost:5000/api/cart/1

###

### 7. Add Another Product to Cart
POST http://localhost:5000/api/cart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "product_id": 2,
  "quantity": 1
}

###

### 8. Update Cart Item Quantity
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/cart/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3
}

###

### 9. Add to Wishlist
POST http://localhost:5000/api/wishlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "product_id": 3
}

###

### 10. View Wishlist
GET http://localhost:5000/api/wishlist/1

###

### 11. Add Another Item to Wishlist
POST http://localhost:5000/api/wishlist
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "product_id": 4
}

###

### 12. Add Delivery Address
POST http://localhost:5000/api/addresses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "address_line1": "123 Main Street",
  "address_line2": "Apartment 4B",
  "city": "Mumbai",
  "state": "Maharashtra",
  "postal_code": "400001",
  "country": "India",
  "is_default": true
}

###

### 13. Add Second Address
POST http://localhost:5000/api/addresses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "address_line1": "456 Park Avenue",
  "address_line2": "Floor 2",
  "city": "Delhi",
  "state": "Delhi",
  "postal_code": "110001",
  "country": "India",
  "is_default": false
}

###

### 14. Get All User Addresses
GET http://localhost:5000/api/addresses/1

###

### 15. Get User Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/profile/1

###

### 16. Update User Profile
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/profile/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "John Smith Doe",
  "mobile": "+91 9999888877",
  "date_of_birth": "1990-01-15"
}

###

### 17. Place Order
POST http://localhost:5000/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 1,
  "shipping_address_id": 1,
  "payment_method": "Cash on Delivery",
  "cart_items": [
    {
      "product_id": 1,
      "quantity": 2,
      "price": 13500
    },
    {
      "product_id": 2,
      "quantity": 1,
      "price": 28000
    }
  ]
}

